DeployCheckP256VerifyAnswerTest
├── when the answer is the word one
│   └── it should pass
├── when the answer is empty
│   ├── it should revert
│   └── it should carry the answer in the error
├── when the answer is the word zero
│   ├── it should revert
│   └── it should carry the answer in the error
├── when the answer is a word above one
│   ├── it should revert
│   └── it should carry the answer in the error
└── when the answer is sixty four bytes
    ├── it should revert
    └── it should carry the answer in the error
